i Nav ../components/Nav
i Panel ../components/Panel
i Tabs ../components/Tabs
i { Tab } from ../components/Tabs
C About
  %page
    Nav
    Panel title="About" as="article"
      slot actions
        Link to="/" "back home"
      p "Components live in .zaal files; the look lives in ui.zaal."
      p "Nest by indentation; \{children\} renders whatever the caller nested."
      p "This panel is an <article>: `as=` names the tag."
    Panel title="How it is built"
      Tabs labels={["Blocks", "Markup", "Design"]}
        Tab at=0
          p "`C` is a component, `S` a store, `H` a hook. One block per file is the default export."
        Tab at=1
          p "Indentation is nesting. `?` branches, `*` maps, `portal` renders elsewhere."
        Tab at=2
          p "`ui.zaal` is the whole look: tokens, element defaults and a kit of named recipes."
      %hint "The tabs above are a `provide` context — each <Tabs> has its own open tab."
